  npcName: Skuld
  npcPortrait: {fileID: -5615041109936842368, guid: b12091506a361c34c840e25d0e578bb9,
    type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Still walking. Good. But this depth doesn\u2019t forgive slow steps or empty
    hands."
  - "The trials ahead demand more than endurance. You\u2019ll need <color=orange>force</color>.
    The Magirissa can forge <color=orange>Youlmopas</color> from <color=orange>lambs
    and pork</color>. "
  - "The <color=orange>gold</color> statue yields them, if you offer faithfully.
    Cook it, eat it, and for <color=orange>thirty seconds</color>, your strikes will
    channel Fortuna\u2019s wrath granting <color=orange>three magic balls</color>
    every attack. "
  - "Gather the meats, bake it, and arm yourself for what\u2019s ahead."
  - May Fortuna bless you.
  - "Then may Fortuna's wrath fly true from your hands\u2014now go, and don't waste
    a single shot."
  typingSpeed: 0.05
